1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,170
For 11 years,

2
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:03,470
I said a career break
isn't a red flag.

3
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:04,842
Then I took one.

4
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,367
18 months. I'd do it again.

5
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:09,757
But coming back was
harder than leaving.

6
00:00:10,350 --> 00:00:12,114
So I took my own advice.

7
00:00:12,144 --> 00:00:13,720
Lead with what you can do.

8
00:00:13,750 --> 00:00:15,436
My experience still fit.

9
00:00:15,466 --> 00:00:17,932
One gap was real,
so I worked on it.

10
00:00:18,250 --> 00:00:19,971
I wrote the break into my story,

11
00:00:20,001 --> 00:00:21,341
in my own words.

12
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:24,639
I practiced the hard questions.

13
00:00:24,669 --> 00:00:27,187
And I sent every
application myself.

14
00:00:28,050 --> 00:00:29,100
I'm back.

15
00:00:30,850 --> 00:00:32,710
A pause isn't a full stop.

